CLASS com/xk72/proxy/ssl/class_1406 com/xk72/proxy/ssl/MaybeKeyShareEntry
	COMMENT [inferred] one TLS 1.3 KeyShareEntry -- a named group and its key_exchange bytes.
	COMMENT TLSExtensionHelper builds these only for extension type 51 (key_share), parsing a list of
